From 9a19443bb07469dac2172b4e18bfad5649e5fdb0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 21:04:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(battle): Fight/Run command menu, enemy
 counterattack, player HP

Battle now runs a proper DQ loop: intro -> Fight/Run menu (the existing
menu primitive with a new MENU_BATTLE id; B can't back out) -> player
damage (with a -1 frame-parity wobble) -> slime counterattack for 1-2 ->
menu again, until the slime dies or the hero flees (MSG_FLEE) or drops
to 0 HP (MSG_DEAD -> revive at full HP back on the field). Player HP
persists between battles and the status window live-updates via a VRAM
packet flushed in GS_BWAIT (hp_dirty).
---
